subckt dut (VDD VSS Vout1 Vout2 Vin\+ Vin\- Vcont\+ Vcont\-)
ISS (net0 VSS) isource dc=1m
M1 (Vout1 Vin\+ A VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M2 (Vout2 Vin\- A VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M3 (Vout2 Vin\+ B VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M4 (Vout1 Vin\- B VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M5 (A Vcont\+ net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
M6 (B Vcont\- net0 VSS) sky130_fd_pr__nfet_01v8 l=0.15 w=1 nf=1 m=1
RD1 (VDD Vout1) resistor r=1k
RD2 (VDD Vout2) resistor r=1k
